Follow the conventions in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Work is not done until the tiered quality gates pass: pre-commit
([.husky/pre-commit](../../.husky/pre-commit)) for fast affected checks, and
pre-push ([.husky/pre-push](../../.husky/pre-push)) for full coverage and build
before sharing.
